.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH jmap 1  "jmap " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
jmap \- JMAP\-specific API
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBjmap\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
JMAP\-specific API.
.PP
Gives access to the raw JMAP API. Every CLI command matches the name of its JMAP counterpart, grouped by domain: mailbox, email, thread, identity, submission, vacation.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
jmap\-query(1)
Send a raw JMAP method\-calls array and print the response
.TP
jmap\-mailbox(1)
Manage JMAP mailboxes
.TP
jmap\-email(1)
Manage JMAP emails
.TP
jmap\-thread(1)
Manage JMAP threads
.TP
jmap\-identity(1)
Manage JMAP sender identities
.TP
jmap\-submission(1)
Manage JMAP email submissions
.TP
jmap\-vacation\-response(1)
Manage JMAP vacation response
.TP
jmap\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
